1
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:08,100
There are 309 roles in this company that can never be empty.

2
00:00:08,533 --> 00:00:11,733
Not for a week. Not for a night.

3
00:00:16,267 --> 00:00:19,900
Each one keeps this plant safe, running and performing.

4
00:00:20,533 --> 00:00:24,267
Talent Management at OQ RPI exists to answer three

5
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:28,333
questions the business cannot afford to get wrong.

6
00:00:28,667 --> 00:00:32,200
Which roles matter most? Who is ready to take them?

7
00:00:32,233 --> 00:00:35,367
And what must we build before we need it?

8
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:45,533
It starts with an honest conversation: 680 performance reviews this year.

9
00:00:45,867 --> 00:00:51,000
Then, once a year, our leaders sit in one room and decide who will lead us next.

10
00:00:51,333 --> 00:00:53,933
Today, 43 are ready to step up.

11
00:00:58,267 --> 00:00:59,800
Then we build them.

12
00:01:00,033 --> 00:01:03,567
237 leaders through MASAR since 2023.

13
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:10,767
24 more in ROBBAN this October, with the Center for Creative Leadership.

14
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:16,733
And secondments across OQ and national institutions bring new capability home.

15
00:01:19,667 --> 00:01:22,033
And we plan every handover.

16
00:01:22,367 --> 00:01:27,733
132 of our 309 critical roles already have a named successor.

17
00:01:27,767 --> 00:01:34,733
Named is not the same as ready: readiness is confirmed in the Talent Review.

18
00:01:35,267 --> 00:01:41,333
By 2030, 242 roles held today by international experts are planned to be

19
00:01:41,367 --> 00:01:46,300
led by Omanis, with each expert staying on as a mentor.

20
00:01:46,533 --> 00:01:50,433
99 Omani successors are already named.

21
00:01:53,567 --> 00:02:02,000
When people go above and beyond, we notice: 1,369 recognitions in eight months.

22
00:02:02,533 --> 00:02:07,733
All of it lives in one place, the Talent Command Center, live for every leader.

23
00:02:08,067 --> 00:02:12,067
Ask it a question, in English or in Arabic, and it answers.

24
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:19,433
This is the capability OQ RPI is building.

25
00:02:19,767 --> 00:02:22,700
Continuity for the roles that matter most.

26
00:02:22,733 --> 00:02:28,967
Leaders ready before they are needed. And Omani talent at the heart of the business.

27
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:34,833
The remaining 177 critical roles are the work ahead.

28
00:02:40,767 --> 00:02:43,433
The future is not built by systems.

29
00:02:44,267 --> 00:02:46,067
It is built by people.

30
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:53,267
OQ RPI Talent Management. Building tomorrow's talent, together.

